        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nomad Nightmare – Episode 2: Haunted House</strong> is the continuation of the psychological horror where reality shatters once again. After the events of the motel, the protagonist tries to return to normal life — grabbing food with a friend, running errands, driving through the night. But the shadow from the past hasn’t vanished. Now he’s being followed by someone who appears in reflections, alleyways, and sometimes right behind him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious house where every creak and silhouette twists your perception. What’s real, and what’s just fear taking shape? Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and hold on to your sanity before the nightmare consumes you completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological thriller with detective elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere of tension enhanced by dynamic sound and visual distortion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuation of the Nomad Nightmare story — uncover who’s behind the horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive environments and new types of puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This second episode dives deeper into the fear of the unknown — showing that true horror doesn’t always live in dreams. Sometimes, it’s right beside you...</p>",
